01:09:28.620 --> 01:09:33.660
disappointment, love for Jim, while also playing this character.
失望，以及对吉姆的爱，同时还要扮演这个角色。

1711
01:09:33.860 --> 01:09:34.920
So it was very layered.
所以这非常有层次感。

1712
01:09:35.080 --> 01:09:35.580
Very layered.
非常有层次。

1713
01:09:35.700 --> 01:09:39.600
And also, he's probably vulnerable because he's sharing his family memories.
而且，他可能也很脆弱，因为他在分享自己的家庭记忆。

