2111
01:29:42.430 --> 01:29:43.370
Oh, my gosh, great.
噢，天哪，太棒了。

2112
01:29:43.630 --> 01:29:49.570
He does this like, woo-boo, spin move, and completely crashes into the food table.
他做了一个类似“呜呼”的旋转动作，然后整个人撞到了餐桌上。

2113
