Well, Toby is still blabbering on and on, and Nellie tells him to stop.
托比还在喋喋不休，奈莉让他闭嘴。

2185
01:32:54.010 --> 01:32:54.810
Stop talking.
别说了。

2186
01:32:54.810 --> 01:32:57.690
And Toby says, are you going to kiss me?
托比说，你是要吻我吗？

2187
01:32:57.830 --> 01:32:59.210
And she says, yes.
