2193
01:33:12.950 --> 01:33:13.230
Okay.
好的。

2194
01:33:13.230 --> 01:33:16.850
It was, at first, her just trying to get him to shut up.
起初，确实只是她想让他闭嘴。

2195
01:33:16.990 --> 01:33:18.650
She's like, yeah, sure.
她当时想的是，行吧，随你便。

2196
01:33:19.070 --> 01:33:19.310
Yeah.
是啊。

2197
01:33:19.390 --> 01:33:21.890
But then after their smooch, she's like, wow.
但亲吻之后，她心想，哇。

2198
01:33:22.730 --> 01:33:23.550
Like, who?
